heading: "Privacy"
intro: "A plain-language summary of what this website collects and why."
---
## What we collect

When you send a form, we receive what you type in it (such as your name, email, phone and coin details). The forms are handled by our website host, Netlify.

## How we use it

Only to reply to you and to handle your submission. We do not sell your information.

## Lookups

When you verify a certificate, the number you type is checked against our certificate records. Your IP address is used briefly to stop abuse of the lookup.

## Contact

Questions about your information: see the [Contact page](/contact).
